-- Purpose: Controls the UI, display, and client-side interactions for the Legendary Car Shop.
-- Runs on: Client
-- Location: StarterPlayerScripts.LegendaryShopController
-- Dependencies: ReplicatedStorage.CarStats, ReplicatedStorage.ShopFrontendKit
-- Public API: None (Event-driven)
-- Networking: Listens to OpenLegendaryShop, LegendaryShopUpdate. Invokes GetLegendaryShopState, CraftLegendaryCar, SacrificeLegendaryIngredient.
-- Security: UI debounces to prevent spam. Server acts as absolute authority for stock, funds, and car ownership.
-- Performance: Safe recursive UI lookups executed only during UI state changes; zero per-frame loops.
-- Notes: Implements recursive searches for nested Craft buttons inside ScrollingFrames.

